                                "sense_id": "345d9588-6b99-3bcc-aaa8-0a4fab79465f",
                                "text": "A buffle headed sub-chanter having been found guilty of absconsion from his butlership scuddled hastily with colubrine steps into the seclusion of his battish eggery."
