                                "sense_id": "345d9588-6b99-3bcc-aaa8-0a4fab79465f",
                                "text": "around 1900, O. Henry, Lost on Dress Parade\nJust then a girl scuddled lightly around the corner, slipped on a patch of icy snow and fell plump upon the sidewalk."
